{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00268","headline":"奉和圣制立春日侍宴内殿出翦彩花应制 · 上官昭容","name":"奉和圣制立春日侍宴内殿出翦彩花应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密叶因裁吐，新花逐翦舒。\n攀条虽不谬，摘橤讵知虚。\n春至由来发，秋还未肯疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官昭容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}